cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "interactor-mixer-auth-guest: the player's key and proof for the Mixer relay, as one guest ELF"
abstract: >
  A P-256 key, its thumbprint and an ECDSA proof over the relay's nonce, in plain C over mbedTLS. One source builds for
  the RISC-V sandbox guest (Godot, Blender, a browser) and for a native test, so every client signs in the same way.
authors:
